### InvasionManager::Invasion ###
	Index           0-29, fixed (MAX_INVASION).
	RespawnMessage  Message index (Message_<LANG>.txt) broadcast when
	                the invasion starts. -1 = none.
	DespawnMessage  Message index broadcast when the invasion time runs
	                out. -1 = none.
	BossIndex       Monster class of the invasion's boss. -1 = none.
	BossMessage     Message index broadcast when the boss is killed.
	                -1 = none.
	InvasionTime    Duration in seconds once started.

	Child <StartTime> - one or more scheduled triggers, matched against
	the real-world clock (-1 = any/wildcard for that field):
		Year/Month/Day/DayOfWeek/Hour/Minute/Second

	Child <Respawn> - one or more spawn-point groups (0-19):
		Group   Respawn group id (0-19, MAX_INVASION_RESPAWN_GROUP).
		Map     Map number this respawn point is on.
		Value   Spawn point reference (see CInvasionManager::SetMonster).

	Child <Monster> - one or more monster entries spawned during the
	invasion:
		Group        Which <Respawn> group (0-19) this monster uses.
		MonsterClass Monster class to spawn.
		RegenType    Respawn behavior on death (0 = normal).
		RegenTime    Seconds before respawning after death.

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
-->

